# Dichotomancy: RepeatEach over Permanent.nonLand+TargetedPlayerCtrl+tapped
# -- only the tapped Grizzly Bears, the untapped Elves are skipped. For it,
# ChooseCard | QuasiLibrarySearch$ TargetedPlayer offers the cards of the
# opponent's library sharing its name (Choices$ Card.TargetedPlayerOwn+
# !IsImprinted+sharesNameWith Remembered), the library Bears is picked and
# imprinted, and DBChangeZone | GainControl$ True | Searched$ True puts it onto
# the battlefield under the caster's control. DBShuffle shuffles the
# opponent's library (one card left, so the order is fixed).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 U
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
tapformana human 7 U
tapformana human 8 U
tapformana human 9 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets ai
castspell human 10
queue cardchoice 13
resolvestack
